{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215160","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621516001:1":{"text":"就是这群乌合之众！","source_cn":"就是这群乌合之众！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60EBCDD8B6FBA203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621516002:1":{"text":"喵、喵丽丝大人……我、我和他们可不是一伙的……！","source_cn":"喵、喵丽丝大人……我、我和他们可不是一伙的……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572B5E3507FB894C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621516003:1":{"text":"真是热闹，像极了莱希拉姆的茶会——不过茶呢？糕点呢？","source_cn":"真是热闹，像极了莱希拉姆的茶会——不过茶呢？糕点呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6176B8AF0815A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621516004:1":{"text":"啊，只有一群不请自来的宾客，在讨论该不该背叛我。","source_cn":"啊，只有一群不请自来的宾客，在讨论该不该背叛我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95584CDE84BEDBB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621516005:1":{"text":"不是背叛，是反抗！你想掌控莱希拉姆，我们不会让你得逞！","source_cn":"不是背叛，是反抗！你想掌控莱希拉姆，我们不会让你得逞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD5831AFE61B311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621516006:1":{"text":"“我们”？你身边这几位连合唱都唱不齐的小动物，便是你所谓的“队伍”？","source_cn":"“我们”？你身边这几位连合唱都唱不齐的小动物，便是你所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB72E1F69594C28F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621516007:1":{"text":"你还是那么天真，汪达尔。","source_cn":"你还是那么天真，汪达尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BC4355270B2295F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621516008:1":{"text":"我不会看着你利用动物的信任，破坏我们和人类之间的纽带！","source_cn":"我不会看着你利用动物的信任，破坏我们和人类之间的纽带！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x924EFC06D56ED7F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621516009:1":{"text":"纽带？哈……真是忠诚得令我感动。","source_cn":"纽带？哈……真是忠诚得令我感动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47FC1496D93BDBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621516010:1":{"text":"你在人类面前摇了那么久的尾巴，恐怕离了人类，连口饭都吃不上了吧？","source_cn":"你在人类面前摇了那么久的尾巴，恐怕离了人类，连口饭都吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A69D8CE8FE890A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621516011:1":{"text":"看看你那退化的獠牙与爪子，真是动物界的耻辱！","source_cn":"看看你那退化的獠牙与爪子，真是动物界的耻辱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5085656EEA2C89BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621516012:1":{"text":"是啊，我们退化的是獠牙与爪子，而得到的是爱与信任。","source_cn":"是啊，我们退化的是獠牙与爪子，而得到的是爱与信任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE90026AC062D531","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621516013:1":{"text":"真是笑话，信任要靠实力维护，不是靠摇尾巴。","source_cn":"真是笑话，信任要靠实力维护，不是靠摇尾巴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2018A722F933B1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1621516014:1":{"text":"不过话说回来，你们凑到一起，是为了喊口号，还是……挑战我？","source_cn":"不过话说回来，你们凑到一起，是为了喊口号，还是……挑战我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64FE96D0245EBBA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621516015:1":{"text":"我们站在一起，就是为了让你停下！喵丽丝，本汪在此，正式向你发出挑战！","source_cn":"我们站在一起，就是为了让你停下！喵丽丝，本汪在此，正式...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E9C6C68FBE28A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621516016:1":{"text":"喵哈哈……接受你的挑战，我要让你明白以我为敌是多么蠢！","source_cn":"喵哈哈……接受你的挑战，我要让你明白以我为敌是多么蠢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93C637E0BB4DBD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","v